1
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:05,730
Pending orders wait here until the price reaches them. Right-click one to see what you can do.

2
00:00:05,830 --> 00:00:08,890
Modify Order changes its rate or amount.

3
00:00:08,990 --> 00:00:12,250
Remove Order cancels just this one.

4
00:00:12,350 --> 00:00:15,780
Stop and Limit attach a stop loss and take profit that start working once the order fills.

5
00:00:15,880 --> 00:00:20,640
The stop is measured from the price the order will fill at, not today's price.

6
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:26,130
Click Ok to save it, or Cancel to leave it.

7
00:00:26,230 --> 00:00:29,990
Trailing Stop attaches a stop that follows the price once the order fills.

8
00:00:30,090 --> 00:00:33,350
Comment adds a short note to the order.

9
00:00:33,450 --> 00:00:37,010
Bulk Operations cancels many orders at once: all of them, only limits, or only stops.

10
00:00:37,110 --> 00:00:40,230
Click Cancel All Orders.

11
00:00:40,330 --> 00:00:43,620
It asks first, and shows how many orders will be cancelled.

12
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:49,130
Click Cancel Orders.

13
00:00:49,230 --> 00:00:52,130
All pending orders are cancelled.

